          "kind": "item",
          "art": "../../Database/GameData/zzz/assets/items/CardDailyUse1381.webp",
          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605",
            "type": "Medal"
          },
          "text": "Soldier 0 - Anby has awakened the Mindscape Cinema: [Static Charge].\n[Static Charge]: When Soldier 0 - Anby uses an EX Special Attack to hit an enemy, it triggers the additional DMG from White Thunder 3 times. This effect does not consume any White Thunder stacks."
