          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605",
            "type": "Medal"
          },
          "text": "Ju Fufu has evoked the Mindscape: [Super Scary Little Tiger].\n[Super Scary Little Tiger]: Upon entering combat, Ju Fufu's CRIT Rate increases by 12%, and she immediately gains 100 Might. When Ju Fufu's Chain Attack hits an enemy, when the target is Stunned, the target's Stun DMG Multiplier increases by 35%, lasting for 30s."
