          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605"
          },
          "text": "Deal 50% more DMG with EX Special Attack: Bubblegum Barrage, EX Special Attack: Special Photography Technique, Chain Attack: Don't Mess With the Cat, and Ultimate: Smash It All!. Bubblegum's Basic Attack: Naughty Cat Spotted is changed to Basic Attack: Bubblegum Barrage. DMG dealt is regarded as EX Special Attack DMG."
