          "art": "../../Database/GameData/zzz/assets/items/Relic078.webp",
          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605"
          },
          "text": "Reduces the number of attacks required to trigger Cat's Gaze, and when an enemy is afflicted with Cat's Gaze, their Anomaly Buildup Rate is increased by 20% for 10s. When Cat's Gaze hits a target afflicted with Ether Anomaly, Electric Attribute Anomaly, Fire Attribute Anomaly, Physical Attribute Anomaly, Ice Attribute Anomaly or Wind Attribute Anomaly, it also triggers one instance of Abloom: applies one additional instance of Attribute Anomaly DMG equal to 370%/192%/480%/30%/48%/19% of original Attribute Anomaly DMG."
