          "kind": "item",
          "art": "../../Database/GameData/zzz/assets/items/Relic083.webp",
          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605"
          },
          "text": "Nangong Yu's Anomaly Proficiency increases by 60. For every 1 Downbeat consumed, she restores 0.15 Energy. After triggering Precise Charging with the first hit of Basic Attack: Adorable Explosive Impact, press to launch a Chain Attack. When Precise Charging is triggered, Anomaly Buildup Rate increases by 20% for 30s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
